{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>חלבמו</b> — lacking a bet: בחלבמו." "<b>סגרו פימו</b> — they spoke with arrogance." "Or <b>חלבמו</b> — closed within them, and <b>פימו</b> — speaking arrogance. The first is correct in my eyes, for it follows the pattern of 'כי כסה פניו בחלבו' (Job 15:27)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:26.453521213Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}